    thinking: "**Extracting Components Thought**\n\nI\'m making good progress! I\'ve started extracting components from the main application file, `App.tsx`, to improve organization and prevent code bloat. First, I\'m focusing on the `Header.tsx` component, including the phone number and free consultation info. It should make a nice modular building block for the landing page.\n\n\n**Expanding Component Scope**\n\nI\'m now expanding the component extraction to include several key sections. I plan to create `TestSection.tsx` for the self-test, `CalculatorSection.tsx` for the program configurator, `MotivationGuide.tsx` for the educational widget, and `FAQSection.tsx` for the FAQ. I also need to make sure that the header links smooth scroll to their appropriate sections. Finally, I\'ll need to figure out the best implementation for the consultation callback button, inline form, and modals.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/Header.tsx`, which serves as a highly polished, responsive, glassmorphic navigation bar. It includes a pulsing hotline number, menu navigation links that support smooth scrolling, and a callback request button to maximize conversions."
