  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Project Structure**\n\nI\'ve just finished outlining the foundational structure, creating the core directories and some vital files, like `types.ts`, `data.ts`, and component files, including `Header.tsx`, `TestSection.tsx`, `CalculatorSection.tsx`, `MotivationGuide.tsx`, and `FAQSection.tsx`. We\'re off to a fantastic start with a solid groundwork established!\n\n\n**Integrating App Components**\n\nI\'m now integrating the foundational component parts within `App.tsx`! I\'ve visualized the integration of components. My layout design for `App.tsx` has been done, and I\'ve sketched the sections: the Hero Section with emotionally charged content, key statistics in a grid, and an About Section in two columns.\n\n\n**Defining Program Layout**\n\nI\'m presently focusing on laying out the core treatment programs. I\'m building a horizontal grid that showcases our programs, each linked to the calculator. Clicking a program button, like \"\320\237\320\276\320\264\321\200\320\276\320\261\320\275\320\265\320\265\" or \"\320\240\320\260\321\201\321\201\321\207\320\270\321\202\320\260\321\202\321\214\", now scrolls directly to the calculator, pre-filling that program\'s details. I\'m also ensuring a smooth visual transition.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now edit `/src/App.tsx` to construct the entire landing page, pulling in all the interactive, data-driven components we built. The landing page has a cohesive aesthetic theme of deep stone, emerald-green forest colors, and premium typography. It features hero displays, real-time statistics, therapeutic descriptions, doctor grids, client success testimonials, and an immersive contact capture."
