    user_response: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#FDFCF8] text-[#3A3F33] flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-20 border-b border-[#E8E6DE] flex items-center justify-between px-16\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#6B705C] rounded-sm rotate-45 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-[#FDFCF8] rounded-sm\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase\\\">Family Rehub</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-10 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#6B705C]\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Programs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">The Center</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Family Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Admissions</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 border border-[#3A3F33] text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-[#3A3F33] hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n      24/7 HELPLINE\\n    </button>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-24 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-5 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] border border-[#6B705C] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] border border-[#6B705C] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <span class=\\\"text-[#6B705C] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-6\\\">A Path to Shared Healing</span>\\n    <h1 class=\\\"text-7xl font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-8 max-w-4xl\\\">\\n      Restoring the <span class=\\\"italic\\\">strength</span> of the family unit.\\n    </h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"text-xl text-[#6B705C] max-w-2xl mb-12\\\">\\n      Family Rehub provides specialized care for individuals and their families, focusing on sustainable recovery through systemic therapy and expert medical guidance.\\n    </p>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"bg-[#6B705C] text-white px-10 py-4 text-lg font-medium shadow-lg\\\">\\n        Start Your Journey\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"border border-[#E8E6DE] px-10 py-4 text-lg font-medium bg-white\\\">\\n        View Our Facilities\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Feature Grid (Geometric Balance) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 h-64 border-t border-[#E8E6DE]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#E8E6DE] p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">01 \342\200\224 Specialized Care</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Intensive Therapy</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Evidence-based psychological support tailored to individual needs and history.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#E8E6DE] p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">02 \342\200\224 Family Unity</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Family Integration</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Healing the ecosystem of the home to ensure a supportive environment for long-term sobriety.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">03 \342\200\224 Aftercare</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Lifelong Support</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Our commitment doesn\'t end at discharge. We provide a bridge back to a purposeful life.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-16 bg-[#3A3F33] text-[#A5A58D] flex items-center justify-between px-16 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\\\">\\n    <div>\302\251 2024 Family Rehub \342\200\224 Zurich, Switzerland</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <span>Privacy Policy</span>\\n      <span>Terms of Service</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-white italic\\\">Confidentiality Guaranteed</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#FDFCF8] text-[#3A3F33] flex flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-20 border-b border-[#E8E6DE] flex items-center justify-between px-16\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#6B705C] rounded-sm rotate-45 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-[#FDFCF8] rounded-sm\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase\\\">Family Rehub</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-10 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#6B705C]\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Programs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">The Center</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Family Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Admissions</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 border border-[#3A3F33] text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-[#3A3F33] hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n      24/7 HELPLINE\\n    </button>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-24 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-5 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] border border-[#6B705C] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] border border-[#6B705C] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <span class=\\\"text-[#6B705C] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-6\\\">A Path to Shared Healing</span>\\n    <h1 class=\\\"text-7xl font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-8 max-w-4xl\\\">\\n      Restoring the <span class=\\\"italic\\\">strength</span> of the family unit.\\n    </h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"text-xl text-[#6B705C] max-w-2xl mb-12\\\">\\n      Family Rehub provides specialized care for individuals and their families, focusing on sustainable recovery through systemic therapy and expert medical guidance.\\n    </p>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"bg-[#6B705C] text-white px-10 py-4 text-lg font-medium shadow-lg\\\">\\n        Start Your Journey\\n      </button>\\n      <button class=\\\"border border-[#E8E6DE] px-10 py-4 text-lg font-medium bg-white\\\">\\n        View Our Facilities\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Feature Grid (Geometric Balance) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 h-64 border-t border-[#E8E6DE]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#E8E6DE] p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">01 \342\200\224 Specialized Care</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Intensive Therapy</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Evidence-based psychological support tailored to individual needs and history.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#E8E6DE] p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">02 \342\200\224 Family Unity</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Family Integration</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Healing the ecosystem of the home to ensure a supportive environment for long-term sobriety.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-[#F8F7F2] transition-colors\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7B7A4]\\\">03 \342\200\224 Aftercare</span>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\\\">Lifelong Support</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-[#6B705C] leading-relaxed\\\">Our commitment doesn\'t end at discharge. We provide a bridge back to a purposeful life.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-16 bg-[#3A3F33] text-[#A5A58D] flex items-center justify-between px-16 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\\\">\\n    <div>\302\251 2024 Family Rehub \342\200\224 Zurich, Switzerland</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <span>Privacy Policy</span>\\n      <span>Terms of Service</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-white italic\\\">Confidentiality Guaranteed</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
