ote and button styles.\n\n\n**Adjusting Visuals Now**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the \"Reviews\" section. I\'ve updated the section wrapper background and border, and the title pill, updating the heading, subtitle text colors and fonts as well. The review card\'s background, border, and padding have been updated. I\'m also revising the author, relation, recovered period badge, stars, review text, and date.\n\n\n**Refining Design Elements**\n\nI\'m now refining specific design elements in the testimonial callout CTA. I\'ve updated the font of the testimonial numbers to `text-text-secondary font-mono`, and updated all the colors, fonts, and styles for the body, title, paragraph and button. I\'m also changing the styles of the bottom CTA section wrapper.\n\n\n**Updating Footer Styles**\n\nI\'m currently updating the footer styles. I\'ve updated the section wrapper to modify background, border and padding. The logo symbol is also being refined. I\'m updating the logo text color and making a change to the logo\'s background and text. I am also implementing style changes for the website and copyright text.\n\n\n**Refining App.tsx Now**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on `App.tsx` specifically. I\'m focusing on making targeted edits instead of a full replacement, for safety and efficiency. After inspecting the file line ranges, I\'m carefully preparing the specific edit instructions. My goal is to maintain the component\'s existing logic and layout. I\'m aiming for a comprehensive but concise update to this crucial file.\n\n\n"
